krafta combines and adapts two open-source projects. Their notices follow.

==============================================================================
lintapple
https://github.com/gholtzap/lintapple
Copyright (c) 2026 Gavin Holtzapple
MIT License

Adapted material: the check engine in src/check/ (design-policy rules, rendered
geometry, contrast and SVG contrast, accessibility rules, interaction plans and
widget keyboard checks, browser setup), src/playwright.ts, src/cli-error.ts,
examples/good.html, examples/ui.css, and the tests in test/check-*.test.ts.
Changes: theme toggles (class and attribute), storage state, CHROME_PATH,
krafta.config.json loading, and use of the engine inside krafta audit.

==============================================================================
interface-craft
https://github.com/harun-yardimci/interface-craft
Copyright (c) 2026 Harun Yardimci
MIT License

Adapted material: the render audit in src/audit/ (from render_audit.mjs), the
static scanners in src/scan/ (from theme_audit.py, token_audit.py and
hit_area_audit.py, now in TypeScript), and the agent skill in skills/krafta/
(SKILL.md and references/). Changes: ported to strict TypeScript, gate rules
run in the same audit pass, scanner exceptions with reasons, inline
krafta-ignore comments, and commands that use the krafta CLI.

interface-craft in turn adapts the following works (paraphrased and
reconciled; no files copied verbatim). Their notices are kept here because the
skill references carry that material.

make-interfaces-feel-better
https://github.com/jakubkrehel/make-interfaces-feel-better
Copyright (c) 2026 Jakub Krehel - MIT License
Adapted: visual-craft values in skills/krafta/references/visual-craft.md
(concentric radius, layered shadows, image outlines, typography, motion and
performance defaults).

jakubkrehel/skills
https://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills
Copyright (c) 2026 Jakub Krehel - MIT License
Adapted: break / state-machine / variant ideas
(references/stress-and-states.md), typography roles, size floors, grouping
and control spacing (references/visual-craft.md), escalation triggers and
cheapest-fix order (SKILL.md).

emilkowalski/skills
https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills
Copyright (c) 2026 Emil Kowalski - MIT License
Adapted: the motion section of references/visual-craft.md (frequency gate,
easing tokens, durations, interruptibility, gestures, performance).

Taste Skill
https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
Copyright (c) 2026 Leonxlnx - MIT License
Adapted: generic-look tells, copy tells and the logo/category tests in
references/generic-tells.md.

Impeccable
https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
Copyright 2025 Paul Bakaus - Apache License, Version 2.0
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
Adapted: surface modes and direction before code
(references/generic-tells.md), anti-pattern catalogue, OKLCH palette guidance
(references/theming.md), persona pass (references/visual-scan.md), the
interactive-state list (references/interaction-and-feedback.md). Changes:
rules rewritten in other words, reconciled with the skill's priorities, and
scoped by surface type.

